counterfactuals.output:
1. A wave redirector comprising:  
   a first frame body having a first upper surface and a first bottom portion;  
   a second frame body having a second upper surface and a second bottom portion;  
   a plurality of anchor feet mounted to the first and second bottom portions and configured to secure the first and second frame bodies to a support surface; and  
   a redirecting blade having a first end supported by at least one of the first frame body or the second frame body, the redirecting blade being configured to redirect incident waves.
